  "description": "This .NET library provides an easy way to call the MailboxValidator API which validates if an email address is a valid one.\n\nThis module can be used in many types of projects such as:\n\n* validating a user's email during sign up\n* cleaning your mailing list prior to an email marketing campaign\n* a form of fraud check\n\nAn API key is required for this library to function.\n\nGo to https://www.mailboxvalidator.com/plans#api to sign up for FREE API plan and you'll be given an API key.",
